{"3597060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hack And Climb", "steam_appid": 3597060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Launch This Monday + Full Steam Deck &amp; Gamepad Support</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack and Climb </strong>is dropping its <strong>free demo this Monday</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your first chance to grab your weapon, climb the mountain, and feel the pain of every glorious fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo also includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 A brand new <strong>gamepad layout</strong> with two modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Full <strong>Steam Deck compatibility</strong>! Play <strong>anywhere</strong>, fall <strong>everywhere</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've successfully tested the game on the Steam Deck, and we're happy to say it's fully playable. You can use the standard &quot;Gamepad&quot; controls or the touchscreen for more precise input — but honestly, we recommend using the Steam Deck's excellent trackpads as joysticks with Twin Stick mode enabled. It gives you the comfort of a gamepad with the precision of a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your <strong>WISHLIST</strong>, set your alarm, and prepare to chop!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CURSED </strong>into <strong>STEEL </strong>and cast into the <strong>ABYSS</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HE</strong> left you to <strong>RUST</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Instead you <strong>CLIMB</strong>, one spiteful <strong>THROW </strong>at a time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your <strong>RISE </strong>will be his <strong>DOWNFALL</strong>....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/8d0c2ae96541b16a136aff88630e8f5d.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/8d0c2ae96541b16a136aff88630e8f5d.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/8d0c2ae96541b16a136aff88630e8f5d.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack And Climb </strong>is a <strong>physics</strong>-<strong>based</strong> platformer where you play as a <strong>cursed axe</strong> on a grueling ascent in search of revenge.          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/7ab311f50ca83d810a7202b254b71ec1.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/7ab311f50ca83d810a7202b254b71ec1.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/7ab311f50ca83d810a7202b254b71ec1.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c1637f2bdd48739fb2a09cfefc7b208e.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE AXE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your tool with <strong>precision</strong>. <strong>Every</strong> throw is a <strong>risk</strong>, every landing a <strong>triumph</strong>. Miss your mark and pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/76614aa296e8f4c6ddbae9090459ceb5.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/76614aa296e8f4c6ddbae9090459ceb5.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/76614aa296e8f4c6ddbae9090459ceb5.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/28f80bb424611b0b66b6ef5f0465cb29.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim up to 10 unique weapons! Each of them with their own quirks and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/791367a594d2f43ef66004e66109c85c.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/791367a594d2f43ef66004e66109c85c.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/791367a594d2f43ef66004e66109c85c.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=486 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/a3ef61079170fa21b0512a5d39f5f925.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE CLIMB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore breathtaking and untamed environments. Swing through ancient mines, navigate rain-slicked forests, and brave the freezing storms of the mountain.              </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c5159485063daa861ffccb6c225b0de6.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c5159485063daa861ffccb6c225b0de6.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c5159485063daa861ffccb6c225b0de6.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a combination of precise, skill-based gameplay and beautiful, atmospheric environments <strong>Hack And Climb</strong> is a game that anyone can play, but only few can master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Platforming</strong>: Master the art of throwing and climbing with your axe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unlockable Weapons</strong>: Discover new ways to conquer &quot;The Climb&quot; as you progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Fair</strong>: Each stage tests your skills while rewarding persistence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Landscapes</strong>: Explore breathtaking, untamed environments each with unique mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hard&quot; and &quot;Legendary&quot; Difficulties</strong>: Reaching the peak is just the beginning.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.poster.avif?t=1769550285\" width=432 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/3366c5a8e468514c2f0f13344553725c.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CURSED </strong>into <strong>STEEL </strong>and cast into the <strong>ABYSS</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HE</strong> left you to <strong>RUST</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Instead you <strong>CLIMB</strong>, one spiteful <strong>THROW </strong>at a time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your <strong>RISE </strong>will be his <strong>DOWNFALL</strong>....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste