avif?t=1769550285\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c5159485063daa861ffccb6c225b0de6.webm?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597060/extras/c5159485063daa861ffccb6c225b0de6.mp4?t=1769550285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a combination of precise, skill-based gameplay and beautiful, atmospheric environments <strong>Hack And Climb</strong> is a game that anyone can play, but only few can master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Platforming</strong>: Master the art of throwing and climbing with your axe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Unlockable Weapons</strong>: Discover new ways to conquer &quot;The Climb&quot; as you progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Fair</strong>: Each stage tests your skills while rewarding persistence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Landscapes</strong>: Explore breathtaking, untamed environments each with unique mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hard&quot; and &quot;Legendary&quot; Difficulties</strong>: Reaching the peak is just the beginning.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Be the weapon! Swing like an axe, thrust like a spear, and soar like an arrow in this physics-based platformer. Flip, throw, and carve your path to the peak! Rage burns, revenge awaits... Are you up to the challenge?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified C